// 出生全史在此前完整验证，打开纯控制折叠在Legacy2授权前；原NPC通路写前拒由中央调用口明确保证。
#include "born_personal_dialogue_world.hpp"
#include "born_personal_dialogue_control.hpp"
#include "resident/kernel/world_bundle.hpp"
namespace hanmo::resident {namespace {
Status enabled(const WorldBundle& w){return w.dynamic_enabled()&&w.catalog->common&&w.catalog->interaction&&w.catalog->born_personal_dialogues&&w.interaction.born_personal_dialogues&&w.family_birth_enabled()&&w.catalog->family_lineage&&w.family_life_enabled()?common_success():common_failure("BornPersonalDialogueProfileRequired");}
Status player(const WorldBundle& w,const StableId& actor){auto valid=command_common_guard(w,actor,"open_born_personal_dialogue");if(!valid.ok)return valid;return actor==w.common.state().metadata.player_actor_id?common_success():common_failure("BornPersonalDialoguePlayerRequired");}
}
BornPersonalDialogueWorldAccess::BornPersonalDialogueWorldAccess(const WorldBundle& w):world_(w),deaths_(w.family_death_read()),sources_{
    [this](const StableId& actor){return read_born_actor_source(world_.common,*world_.catalog->common,*world_.catalog->family_lineage,world_.family_birth,deaths_,actor);},
    [this](const StableId& actor,Integer tick,const StableId& fact){return read_born_actor_source_before_fact(world_.common,*world_.catalog->common,*world_.catalog->family_lineage,world_.family_birth,deaths_,actor,tick,fact);},
    [this](const StableId& actor,Integer tick,const StableId& fact){return read_actor_presence_before_fact(world_.common,*world_.catalog->common,deaths_,actor,tick,fact);},
    [this](Integer tick,const StableId& fact){return born_personal_dialogue_player_before(world_.common,world_.family,world_.family_legacy_enabled()?&world_.family_legacy:nullptr,tick,fact);}
},interaction_(w.services.interaction_access()),read_(w.common,w.interaction,*w.interaction.born_personal_dialogues,*w.catalog->interaction,*w.catalog->born_personal_dialogues,interaction_,sources_){}
Outcome<std::shared_ptr<BornPersonalDialogueWorldAccess>> BornPersonalDialogueWorldAccess::create(const WorldBundle& w){auto valid=enabled(w);if(!valid.ok)return {false,{},valid.error};return {true,std::shared_ptr<BornPersonalDialogueWorldAccess>(new BornPersonalDialogueWorldAccess(w)),{}};}
Outcome<bool> match_born_personal_dialogue_session_world(const WorldBundle& w,const InteractionSession& session){if(!w.catalog->born_personal_dialogues&&!w.interaction.born_personal_dialogues)return {true,false,{}};auto valid=enabled(w);if(!valid.ok)return {false,{},valid.error};return match_born_personal_dialogue_session(w.common,*w.interaction.born_personal_dialogues,*w.catalog->born_personal_dialogues,*w.catalog->interaction,session);}
Status validate_born_personal_dialogue_world(const WorldBundle& w){const auto* state=w.interaction.born_personal_dialogues?&*w.interaction.born_personal_dialogues:nullptr;auto valid=validate_born_personal_dialogue_layout(w.common,w.catalog->identity.module_versions,w.catalog->born_personal_dialogues.get(),state);if(!valid.ok)return valid;if(state){auto access=BornPersonalDialogueWorldAccess::create(w);if(!access.ok)return {false,{},access.error};valid=validate_born_personal_dialogues(w.common,w.interaction,*state,*w.catalog->interaction,*w.catalog->born_personal_dialogues,access.value->sources());if(!valid.ok)return valid;}return validate_born_personal_dialogue_cached_results(w.common,state);}
Outcome<BornPersonalDialogueQuote> prepare_born_personal_dialogue_world(const WorldBundle& w,const StableId& actor,const OpenBornPersonalDialogue& request){auto valid=player(w,actor);if(!valid.ok)return {false,{},valid.error};auto access=BornPersonalDialogueWorldAccess::create(w);if(!access.ok)return {false,{},access.error};return preview_born_personal_dialogue(w.common,w.interaction,*w.interaction.born_personal_dialogues,*w.catalog->interaction,*w.catalog->born_personal_dialogues,access.value->interaction(),access.value->sources(),actor,request);}
Outcome<InteractionEffect> commit_born_personal_dialogue_world(WorldBundle& w,const StableId& actor,const OpenBornPersonalDialogue& request,const BornPersonalDialogueQuote& quote){auto valid=player(w,actor);if(!valid.ok)return {false,{},valid.error};auto access=BornPersonalDialogueWorldAccess::create(w);if(!access.ok)return {false,{},access.error};auto written=open_born_personal_dialogue_in_candidate(w.common,w.interaction,*w.interaction.born_personal_dialogues,*w.catalog->interaction,*w.catalog->born_personal_dialogues,access.value->interaction(),access.value->sources(),actor,request,quote);if(!written.ok)return {false,{},written.error};InteractionEffect result;result.settlement_result=written.value;return {true,std::move(result),{}};}
Outcome<BoundaryValue> query_born_personal_dialogue_world(const WorldBundle& w,Integer cursor){auto access=BornPersonalDialogueWorldAccess::create(w);if(!access.ok)return {false,{},access.error};return query_born_personal_dialogues(w.common,w.interaction,*w.interaction.born_personal_dialogues,*w.catalog->interaction,*w.catalog->born_personal_dialogues,access.value->interaction(),access.value->sources(),cursor);}
Outcome<StableId> born_personal_dialogue_new_result_world(const WorldBundle& before,const WorldBundle& after,const StableId& actor,const StableId& kind,const ReceiptDetails& details){return born_personal_dialogue_new_player_source(before.interaction.born_personal_dialogues?&*before.interaction.born_personal_dialogues:nullptr,after.interaction.born_personal_dialogues?&*after.interaction.born_personal_dialogues:nullptr,actor,kind,details,after.common.tick());}
Status bind_born_personal_dialogue_result_world(WorldBundle& w,const StableId& source,const StableId& actor,Integer request,const CommitResult& result){if(!w.interaction.born_personal_dialogues)return source.empty()?common_success():common_failure("BornPersonalDialogueProfileRequired");return bind_born_personal_dialogue_player_result(w.common,*w.interaction.born_personal_dialogues,source,actor,request,result);}
}
